  "readmeFile": "README.md",
  "releaseNotes": "eeCLOUD 4.3.2 adds injectable singleton telemetry alongside eeCACHE.\n\nHighlights in this release:\n- Added the dependency-free IeeTelemetry contract and optional Application constructor injection, with per-instance telemetry options.\n- Application.Dispose releases its injected observation registration without disposing the shared telemetry service or cache.\n- Preserved the existing constructor and manual EnableTelemetry API for hosts with their own OpenTelemetry pipeline.\n- Added the optional eeCLOUD.OpenTelemetry package with a shared eeTelemetry service, OTLP/gRPC and OTLP/HTTP exporters, configurable endpoints, headers, sampling and export intervals.\n- Documented singleton registration, Aspire Dashboard, Prometheus metrics, IIS configuration and lifecycle checks.\n- No new dependencies in the core package and no changes to storage or CRUD contracts.",
